message: "If you use Afterward or its dataset joins, please cite it as below."
title: "Afterward: California training programs, their reported outcomes, and where they lead"
abstract: >-
  A public, bilingual (English/Spanish), no-account static site joining every
  California training program reported under WIOA to the state's own ten-year
  occupational projections, with suppressed and unreported outcome measures kept
  distinct from zeros and coverage published as a first-class artifact.
type: software
authors:
